sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Model as Parent model
 participant Parent as Parent scheduler
 participant Owner as CodeModeRunOwner
 participant Guest as QuickJS guest and private IPC
 participant Broker as NestedToolExecutionSession
 participant Child as Separate child scheduler
 participant Policy as Prepared invocation and policy
 participant UI as Approval handler
 participant Host as Real tool host
 participant Sink as Typed result sink
 participant Audit as UI and operational recording
 Model->>Parent: discover_tool_api(shell, read_file)
 Parent-->>Model: admitted declarations and revision
 Model->>Parent: execute_tool_script(source, tools, revision)
 Parent->>Parent: outer policy and execution scope
 Parent->>Owner: execute under caller cancellation
 Owner->>Broker: begin child approval ownership
 Owner->>Guest: fresh credential-free process and VM
 Guest->>Broker: call run_shell_command(resolve HEAD and commits)
 Broker->>Broker: finite FIFO admission, host-issued call ID
 Broker->>Child: lease.schedule(request, signal, inherited hooks)
 Child->>Policy: prepare hook-adjusted invocation, validate and authorize
 Policy-->>Child: ASK with confirmation details
 Child->>UI: exact command + parent script + child call ID
 Note over Guest,UI: Guest promise remains pending, no model inference
 UI-->>Child: approve exact invocation
 Child->>Host: execute approved shell operation
 Host-->>Child: post-hook bounded ToolResult
 Child->>Sink: typed completion before model formatting
 Sink-->>Broker: value and completeness
 Broker-->>Guest: resolve promise
 Child->>Audit: child status, approval, bytes, parent/run IDs
 loop selected files
 Guest->>Broker: read_file(path) then authorized blame query
 Broker->>Child: admitted concrete call
 Child->>Policy: same validation and policy on every call
 alt allowed
 Child->>Host: execute
 Host-->>Sink: bounded post-hook result
 Sink-->>Guest: data for grouping
 else denied or revoked
 Policy-->>Child: DENY
 Child->>Broker: POLICY_VIOLATION
 Broker->>Owner: terminate run, close admission
 Owner->>Guest: interrupt and terminate
 Owner->>Child: abort and join real work, retire approval route
 Owner->>Audit: failure and completed-call summary, no rollback
 Owner-->>Parent: bounded error with partial execution status
 end
 end
 opt no denial and all calls awaited
 Guest->>Guest: group TODOs by blame author, check coverage
 Guest-->>Owner: compact JSON
 Owner->>Broker: close, join, retire approval subscription
 Owner->>Guest: dispose process and handles
 Owner->>Audit: final metrics, discard intermediate buffers
 Owner-->>Parent: one ToolResult
 end
 Parent-->>Model: one meta-tool response in model history
 Note over Model,Audit: Nested records remain outside provider history on both success and failure

